# The worked examples ship the actual frames so each case is self-contained and
# `bash curl.sh` runs from inside its own folder. Those frames are real CGMacros
# subject photographs, so they stay OUT of git until their redistribution terms
# are settled -- a photo pushed once is in the history forever.
#
# The TRANSCRIPTS are tracked: curl.sh, request.json, response.json. They are
# what the examples are for. Regenerate the frames (and the replies) with
#
#     python examples/run_examples.py
#
api/**/*.jpg
api/**/*.jpeg
api/**/*.png
api/**/*.heic
# base64 request bodies embed the same frames.
api/**/body.json
